{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53187","headline":"诗偈 十二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老来无气力，房舍不能修。\n基颓柱根朽，椽梠脱差抽。\n泥涂零落尽，四壁空飕飕。\n举头看梁柱，星星见白头。\n慧云降法雨，智水沃心流。\n家中空豁豁，屋倒亦何忧。\n山庄草庵破，余归大宅游。\n生生不拣处，随类说无求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}